# Example ReRDMFT input file: water, cc-pVDZ (spherical), NON_RELATIVISTIC with dense integrals (USE_RI FALSE) and
# UCCSD with the oxygen 1s core frozen (CC_FROZEN_CORE 2 = two spin-orbitals).
# Reference (PySCF 2.14 RHF + CCSD with frozen=1, same geometry/basis): E(RHF) = -76.0267936450 Eh,
# E_corr = -0.2111965374 Eh; this run gives -76.0267936449 and -0.2111965370 Eh.
NELEC 10
BASIS water-cc-pvdz.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
CARTESIAN FALSE
UCCSD TRUE
USE_RI FALSE
CC_FROZEN_CORE 2

GEOMETRY
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.757000   0.586000
H   0.000000  -0.757000   0.586000
END
